        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■ Concert Details\n\"Kano Live ~Alstroemeria~\"\n[Aichi] Sunday, January 28, 2018, doors 17:30, show 18:00, Nagoya E.L.L\n[Osaka] Sunday, February 4, 2018, doors 17:30, show 18:00, umeda TRAD\n[Tokyo] Monday (national holiday), February 12, 2018, doors 17:15, show 18:00, Shinjuku ReNy"
